{"id":"vod_hh_55517","vodId":"55517","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"魔神BIG-O","name_cn":"魔神BIG-O","date":"1999-01-01","year":"1999","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第26话","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/695494b434b3711f396bc5f0d3c0a54e.jpg"},"summary":"从现在开始算起的100年后、以前被称作曼哈顿的城市，现在被称作“失去记忆的街道”帕拉达伊姆市。这个街上的居民们、从40年前因为一起“为什么”的事件、而只留下这座帕拉达伊姆市，其他全部都被消灭掉、在这之前的记忆也因为这起“为什么”事件而全部失去。但是记忆却有时会以意外的方式而出现。主角罗杰・史密斯是城市里最厉害的谈判专家，他也很热爱这份工作。在失去过去记忆的40年里、虽然街道被重建，不过法律却荡然无存、因此需要谈判的场面也跟着增加。但是要能好好谈判成功的机会却是十分的少、多的是诉诸暴力的对手。在这时、他也驾驶机器人Big O来以牙还牙。就在有天、罗杰被拜托去做一份工作。要与绑架大小姐的绑匪谈判、这份工作对他来说是份轻而易举的工作，...","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-06 21:00:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb422B7e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Xe0MMx5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pdyzz36e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QbYZZKAd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penll35b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel003je/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOGGwRa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penllp5b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejBBlve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8ggJja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel00nMe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepnn0Vb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DdwxxBre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMXXrme/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yerpp32b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aArrV9b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17话","url":"ht